025900                     TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
026000                 GO TO 2-BLOWUP
026100             ELSE
026200                 NEXT SENTENCE
026300         ELSE
026400             GO TO 612-DD-X.
026500
026600     GO TO 612-GET-DPODATAITM.
026700
027500 612-DD-X.
027600     EXIT.
